---
import FeatureCard from '@chassis-ui/docs/components/FeatureCard.astro'
import Code from '@chassis-ui/docs/shortcodes/Code.astro'
---

<section class="home-section py-3xl md:py-6xl">
  <div class="container 2xl section-content">
    <div class="grid mb-3xl md:mb-6xl">
      <header class="section-header col-span-full lg:col-span-10 lg:col-start-2 xl:col-span-8 xl:col-start-3 text-center">
        <h2 class="section-title font-3xl md:font-4xl lg:font-5xl mb-xs md:mb-sm lg:mb-md">
          <span class="font-normal d-block">Checks</span> before a release
        </h2>
        <p class="section-body md:font-lg lg:font-xl m-0">
          The CI workflow that <code>init</code> writes runs both checks on a pull request and on a
          push to <code>main</code>, and the release workflow runs them before it builds and
          publishes.
        </p>
      </header>
    </div>

    <div class="section-features grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-md md:gap-xl">
      <div>
        <FeatureCard icon="cx-filter">
          <Fragment slot="title">Source lint</Fragment>
          <Fragment slot="body">
            <code>chassis-icons lint-source</code> checks each file of <code>source/</code>: its
            name, its frame, one color, no stroke, and the pairs of the styles. It names each file
            that cannot be an icon, and why.
          </Fragment>
          <div class="border-top border-subtle pt-md">
            <Code noToolbar lang="bash" code="npm run lint" />
          </div>
        </FeatureCard>
      </div>

      <div>
        <FeatureCard icon="cx-shield-check">
          <Fragment slot="title">Verify</Fragment>
          <Fragment slot="body">
            <code>chassis-icons verify</code> builds the source and fails on any difference:
          </Fragment>
          <ul class="mb-0">
            <li>Two builds of the source do not give the same files.</li>
            <li>
              <code>codepoints.json</code>, <code>README.md</code> or <code>package.json</code> is
              not what the source builds.
            </li>
            <li>An icon lost the code point it had at the last tag.</li>
            <li>
              An icon that <code>chassis.checks.json</code> lists is missing.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <div class="border-top border-subtle pt-md">
            <Code noToolbar lang="bash" code="npm run verify" />
          </div>
        </FeatureCard>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
